      <li>
        <text>Each section is a part of your network: Club, Board, Archive, Server room, Studio, Gateway. Badges count what needs attention.</text>
      </li>
      <li>
        <text>A glowing section has news. Locked sections show a lock: hover to see how they open.</text>
        <hint>click any section.</hint>
      </li>
    </steps>
  </Netrun.GuideAreaDef>

